{"id": "EUVD-2026-93172", "enisaUuid": "89896ac3-4701-32ca-b05e-b2fd2ff26085", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nbtrfs: clear free space tree creation state on rebuild failure\n\nbtrfs_rebuild_free_space_tree() sets BTRFS_FS_CREATING_FREE_SPACE_TREE\nbefore rebuilding the free space tree.  Several error paths return\nwithout clearing this flag.\n\nThe transaction restart failure path can leave the flag set on a live\nfilesystem, causing delayed reference processing to be skipped. Clear it\non all free space tree rebuild failure paths. Keep\nBTRFS_FS_FREE_SPACE_TREE_UNTRUSTED set, since a failed rebuild leaves\nthe free space tree untrusted. Callers must fall back to extent-tree\ncaching.", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T08:45:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:16:15", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a32bedab8ece9d1f90a1476a5b486a1804dc78ba", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b1df2997d0cd2be7bef7b4ab64ccfd1019dedc81", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3565893cc72cdf6b795cf6a33e7ff9605322334d"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98244", "GHSA-mg7q-63qp-3hvm"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "053b41b3-7670-3d93-9a7f-2bb6e677998f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "054c4c88-1fd2-330c-b34f-619fbf4f25e7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.54"}, {"id": "5be88a67-0baf-34c4-ad7e-fda008e3e960", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "882af9f13e830c0a4ef696bb72cd5998a5067a93 <a32bedab8ece9d1f90a1476a5b486a1804dc78ba"}, {"id": "86f5a97d-5b1c-3298-a0fd-00e6690e5e7f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "882af9f13e830c0a4ef696bb72cd5998a5067a93 <b1df2997d0cd2be7bef7b4ab64ccfd1019dedc81"}, {"id": "954af420-d94b-3769-a6a2-fd4008894e3b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "882af9f13e830c0a4ef696bb72cd5998a5067a93 <3565893cc72cdf6b795cf6a33e7ff9605322334d"}, {"id": "abe7494f-c8af-32ca-ba24-4a52f2d5e8f6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.14"}, {"id": "bee2184d-2786-3055-a724-f37ba43a14e6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.8"}, {"id": "cb6ebadc-d770-3fbc-9cc7-4af84d771def", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "55670d5a-aefa-37fb-8b79-18b95527d0df", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}